cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "passmcp: a step-by-step diagnostic for remote MCP servers"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/passmcp"
abstract: >-
  passmcp connects to a remote Model Context Protocol server with the
  credentials an operator supplies and reports, step by step, what it
  observed: network and TLS, OAuth discovery, token acquisition, the
  initialize handshake, protocol conformance, the tool, resource and
  prompt catalog, safe execution with content validation, latency and
  concurrency, and recovery. Every finding cites the requests that
  produced it, and the score is derived from the findings.
keywords:
  - model-context-protocol
  - mcp
  - oauth
  - diagnostics
  - cli
  - golang
license: GPL-3.0-only
